  "changes": [
    "Fixes V1.2 runtime failure caused by using first trade of each non-empty minute as the 1m open.",
    "Materializes trade-derived 1m candles with previous causal close as the next minute open when available.",
    "Includes previous-close opening point in each trade-bearing minute high/low while retaining real last-trade close and exact summed volume.",
    "Keeps zero-trade minutes as flat previous-close bars with volume 0.",
    "Bumps P53 1m cache to V3 and records explicit continuous-open candle semantics.",
    "Keeps the exact 1m-to-frozen-5m OHLCV equivalence gate; no tolerance or optimizer is introduced.",
    "Adds regression tests for non-empty carry-forward opens, extrema and exact 5m reproduction."
